    "body": "Hi,\n\nI was wondering is there the ability to prevent certain pages from being track in a SPA. The situation I have is that we are using and angular App with an OpenId server that redirects the user with the id_token and access_token in the url path (as per w3c specs), we've noticed that app insight is sending the tokens to the telemetry tracking. How can we prevent/block/rewrite this?\n",
